by League 26's overalls at that position (scripts/data/rugby-league-26.json), as many of each 2025 club's best as the season's clubs carry per club (`quota`), by linear interpolation; rounded and held to 1-99. Club shift: the season's results set each club's level, while its players keep their order. Each club's Simple Rating System, its regular season's margins adjusted for its opponents and a home edge by least squares, is ranked among the season's clubs (mid-rank percentiles) and read off `clubShift.reference`, the built-in 2025 NRL clubs' strengths: its target. Every player of the club moves by the one whole number (`shift`) that brings its matchday 17's strength closest to the target (of two as close, the smaller move), held to 1-99."},"map":"nrl2003","clubs":[{"id":"nrl-bulldogs","name":"Bulldogs","code":"BUL","league":"NRL","country":"036","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 302)","str":85.4,"squad":[["Luke Patten","FB",90],["Matt Utai","WG",89],["Hazem El Masri","WG",84],["Shane Marteene","WG",76],["Nigel Vagana","CE",88],["Ben Harris","CE",84],["Willie Talau","CE",79],["Braith Anasta","FE",84],["Johnathan Thurston","FE",79],["Brent Sherwin","HB",82],["Corey Hughes","HK",82],["Adam Perry","HK",81],["Adam Brideson","HK",74],["Mark O'Meley","PR",89],["Steve Price","PR",89],["Dennis Scott","PR",87],["Glenn Hall","PR",76],["Willie Mason","SR",88],["Andrew Ryan","SR",85],["Jamie Feeney","SR",83],["Glen Hughes","SR",81],["Steve Reardon","SR",77],["Travis Norton","LK",86],["Tony Grimaldi","LK",84]]},{"id":"nrl-sydney-roosters","name":"Sydney Roosters","code":"SYD","league":"NRL","country":"036","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 204)","str":84.8,"squad":[["Anthony Minichiello","FB",91],["Todd Byrne","WG",84],["Chris Walker","WG",82],["Eric Grothe","WG",77],["Ryan Cross","CE",84],["Shannon Hegarty","CE",84],["Justin Hodges","CE",81],["Lelea Paea","CE",78],["Brad Fittler","FE",91],["Brett Finch","HB",91],["Craig Wing","HK",92],["Stuart Webb","HK",78],["Jason Cayless","PR",87],["Todd Payten",